ouched/648/1620077.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Deceived by a married jerk, lawyer Wen Wanqing gets drunk and accidentally kisses her best friend's younger brother, surgeon Pei Yiqiu—who has secretly loved her for years. As misunderstandings give way to romance, she breaks free from her toxic relationship, while he offers the tenderness she's always deserved. A two-way journey that began in their youth finally comes full circle, bringing them both a chance to heal.</p>","updated":1794413722,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95193"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3810539","name":"Episode 14"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3810540","name":"Episode 15"}}}}},{"id":3815405,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815405/rise-of-the-underdog-1x13-episode-13","name":"Episode 13","season":1,"number":13,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-16","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-16T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":12,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815405"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95194","name":"Rise of the Underdog"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":95194,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/95194/rise-of-the-underdog","name":"Rise of the Underdog","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":12,"premiered":"2026-11-12","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc00200s90emd5.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":53,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/650/1627024.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/650/1627024.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Ma Dawei's previous life ends in prison and family ruin, but he suddenly returns to the turning point of his fate. He resolutely avoids the pitfalls, grasps the opportunities of the age, and rises with momentum. Against one scheme after another, Ma Dawei cuts off old entanglements, protects his loved ones with all his strength, sails through the ups and downs of business, and sets off toward a brilliant new future that belongs to him.</p>","updated":1794681557,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95194"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815404","name":"Episode 12"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815405","name":"Episode 13"}}}}},{"id":3816886,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3816886/war-of-thorns-1x21-episode-21","name":"Episode 21","season":1,"number":21,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-16","airtime":"18:00","airstamp":"2026-11-16T10:00:00+00:00","runtime":44,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3816886"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86784","name":"War of Thorns"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":86784,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/86784/war-of-thorns","name":"War of Thorns","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":44,"premiered":"2026-11-06","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc002007ircemz.html","schedule":{"time":"18:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":59,"network":{"id":279,"name":"TVB Jade","country":{"name":"Hong Kong","code":"HK","timezone":"Asia/Hong_Kong"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/650/1625384.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/650/1625384.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Seven years after movie queen Kwan Tsz-ying (Yoyo Chen) \"committed suicide\", her buddy Ha Mo-sheung (Tavia Yeung) somehow obtains Tsz-ying's diary and is shocked to learn she had been betrayed and harmed by her \"nice sisters\" Lai Yi-wan (Rosina Lam), Lam Fung-yee (Elaine Yiu), Leung Fei-nga (Kelly Fu) and Lam On-on (Judy Kwong). To uncover the truth and avenge her friend's death, Mo-sheung uses the co-production film \"The Rose\" as bait to win entertainment company boss Chan Wan-sang (Moses Chan) over so as to recruit the four women to participate.</p>","updated":1794605896,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86784"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3816885","name":"Episode 20"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3816886","name":"Episode 21"}}}}},{"id":3805068,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805068/the-silent-storm-1x25-episode-25","name":"Episode 25","season":1,"number":25,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-16","airtime":"19:30","airstamp":"2026-11-16T11:30:00+00:00","runtime":45,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805068"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/81395","name":"The Silent Storm"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":81395,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/81395/the-silent-storm","name":"The Silent Storm","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Crime"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":45,"premiered":"2026-11-05","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU3NTc1Njg0MA==.html","schedule":{"time":"19:30","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":55,"network":{"id":297,"name":"CCTV-8","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/649/1624724.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/649/1624724.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In 1994, tax auditor Ouyang Xu, criminal investigator Yan Ping'an, and Zhou Haiyang—who was searching for his missing wife—met through a counterfeit invoice case in Chunjiang City. Under the tide of the times, the three experienced vastly different circumstances, and their fates gradually diverged. Years later, Operation Grain Rain brings them together again—but the brothers of old now stand on opposite sides. Ouyang Xu faces off against the tax fraud ring led by Zhou Haiyang and the protective umbrella behind it, caught in a painful choice between emotion and the law. Starting from a single invoice, he tears away the veil of greed and ultimately eliminates evil, safeguarding justice.</p>","updated":1794345229,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/81395"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805067","name":"Episode 24"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805068","name":"Episode 25"}}}}},{"id":3805069,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805069/the-silent-storm-1x26-episode-26","name":"Episode 26","season":1,"number":26,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-16","airtime":"19:30","airstamp":"2026-11-16T11:30:00+00:00","runtime":46,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3805069"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/81395","name":"The Silent Storm"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id"